WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:02.200
Here are 6 dots.

2
00:02.200 --> 00:06.300
Split them into two equal groups.

3
00:06.300 --> 00:08.300
3 and 3. Nothing is left over.

4
00:08.300 --> 00:11.800
So 6 is an even number.

5
